rooms_desc ({"The room has several posters on the walls.  It has black lights, Christmaslights which are on trail, and several other colored lights.  There isa lounge chair in the corner, and a small table with many remote controlsstands next to it.  A collection on CD's is near the stereo, and a TV standopposite the chair.","This room is bare.  The linolium tile shines with a lemony fresh scent thanksto the maid that comes in and cleans every two days.  The only two objectsin this room are a white refrigerator stacked with beer, and a liquor cabinetstocked well.  Inside.. under lock and key, are bottles of J.D., Absolut,Peppermint Schnapps, Amaretto liquor, and other various types of whiskey, ginrum, and vodka","This room is the bathroom, which due to the amount of alcohol consumedin this house, is used very often.  But, once again, due to the maid, theroom itself, and everything in it, is kept spotless","There are many whips and chains in this room.You would swear that many Tuppy's have been tortured inthis room in previous days.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Do not open your eyes if you have ever tripped on acid...","The Alcohol Room","Bathroom","This is the room where helpless little young Tuppy's are tortured.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
