items ({({"lights","The black lights reflect off the posters giving the room a strange aura around it.  The Christmas lights are trailing and if you are tripping... it screws you up.  The other lights are red and blue bulbs scattered aimlessly about the room and a lava lamp in the corner grabs your eye.","collection","There are many CD's here.. including ||\\\\|| || ||//||, Pearl Jam, Nirvana,      Led Zeppelin, the Doors, Eric Clapton, Gun's n Roses, STP, and many others.","chair","This La-Z-Boy lounge chair is so old and worn out, it looks like it belongs     in a frat house.","TV","This is a large screen TV with an extra high resolution.","posters","There is a Pink Floyd - The Wall poster which glows in the black light, and     many posters of various types of race cars.",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
